# Defining this file overrides stow's built-in default ignore list,
# so the defaults we still want must be repeated here.

# --- Stow defaults we want to keep ---
\.git
\.gitignore
^/README.*
^/LICENSE.*

# --- Repo-only meta-docs (not part of live ~/.claude/ config) ---
^/LEARNINGS\.md
^/SKILLS\.md

# --- Tool caches (created by running scripts/, never config) ---
# These are self-ignoring for git (pytest and ruff each write a
# .gitignore containing `*` inside their cache), so they never appear
# in `git status` — but stow has no such notion and would happily link
# them into ~/.claude/. Because this file overrides stow's built-in
# defaults, they must be listed explicitly.
^/\.pytest_cache
^/\.ruff_cache
